<view class="page"><text class="title">遇到问题，乡桥帮你。</text><view class="muted intro">面向种植户、消费者和各服务主体，统一受理、分派、跟进与回访。</view><view class="note">帮助中心原型：热线、坐席、服务时间待配置。所有问题仅本地保存，不收取平台帮助服务费，不拨号、不录音、不发送通知。</view>
 <view class="help-tabs"><button class="{{tab === 'guide' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="guide" bindtap="tab">常见问题</button><button class="{{tab === 'form' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="form" bindtap="tab">寻求帮助</button><button class="{{tab === 'tickets' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="tickets" bindtap="tab">处理进度</button></view>
 <block wx:if="{{tab === 'guide'}}"><view class="surface"><text class="heading">先看看这些答案</text><block wx:for="{{faqs}}" wx:key="id"><button class="row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="faq"><text>{{item.title}}</text><view class="chevron"/></button><view wx:if="{{selectedFaq === item.id}}" class="small muted help-answer">{{item.answer}}</view></block></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="hotline">人工帮助与回访说明</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{!context}}"><view class="empty"><view class="intro muted">常见问题无需登录；登记问题和查看私有进度需要进入账号。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">进入演示账号</button></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{tab === 'form'}}"><view class="surface"><text class="heading">登记问题或回访意向</text><view class="small muted help-context">{{context.identity.org}} · {{context.identity.label}}<view>切换身份后不共享私有帮助记录。</view></view><view class="field"><text class="label">问题类型</text><picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="category"><view class="input">{{categories[categoryIndex]}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">希望怎样回复</text><picker range="{{methods}}" value="{{methodIndex}}" bindchange="method"><view class="input">{{methods[methodIndex]}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">问题说明（仅测试）</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{description}}" maxlength="1000" bindinput="edit" placeholder="8–1000字，可写关联地块或业务示例，勿填真实电话、密钥等"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save">保存本地帮助登记</button><view class="small muted gap">不上传真实附件、不自动代办验收或退款。紧急人身安全问题不要等待平台工单。</view></view></block>
 <block wx:else><view wx:if="{{selectedTicket}}" class="surface"><text class="pill">{{selectedTicket.status}} · 演示</text><text class="heading gap">{{selectedTicket.category}}</text><view class="small muted">{{selectedTicket.org}} · {{selectedTicket.role}}</view><view class="gap">{{selectedTicket.description}}</view><view class="kv"><text>回复方式</text><text>{{selectedTicket.method}}</text></view><text class="heading gap">处理轨迹</text><view wx:for="{{selectedTicket.timeline}}" wx:key="*this" class="help-step">{{item}}</view><view class="note">客服受理不等于验收通过、完成退款或已经回访。当前没有真实坐席处理。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="back">返回问题列表</button></view><view wx:elif="{{tickets.length}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">当前身份的问题</text><button wx:for="{{tickets}}" wx:key="id" class="row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row-copy"><text>{{item.category}}</text><view class="small muted">{{item.status}} · {{item.method}}</view></view><view class="chevron"/></button></view><view wx:else class="empty muted">当前身份暂无帮助记录，先到“寻求帮助”登记。</view></block>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="success">{{notice}}</view><view class="demo-foot">单账号多身份 · 不含商户分账管理</view>
</view>
